'<p>We do not sell your personal information. Your Plan is generated from pre-written content; we do not send your answers to AI services. We may also disclose information if the law requires it, to protect our rights, or as part of a sale or merger of our business.</p>',
P('5. Cookies and advertising','This website does not currently use advertising or analytics cookies. Before we add any, we will update this policy to describe them and any choices you have.'),
P('6. How long we keep it',"Questionnaire answers and Plan files: while you are a customer, then deleted within 12 months after your Plan is delivered (Plan only) or after your subscription ends, unless you ask us to delete them sooner or a legal hold applies. Records of purchases and consents: at least 3 years, or 1 year after your subscription ends if that is later. Payment records: 7 years for tax purposes. Support emails: 3 years. Deletion covers the providers listed above, on their own deletion schedules."),
P('7. How we protect it','We use two-step login on the accounts that hold your information, rely on our providers\' encryption in transit and at rest, and limit access to the people who need it.'),
P('8. Your choices and rights',"You can ask to see, correct or delete your information, or opt out of marketing, by emailing "+E+". We'll respond within 30 days. California residents have additional rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act where it applies, and we won't treat you differently for using them."),
